# Storm Spire's storm cellar (CIPlay storm_spire_caves, 11-12 w09; in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in the recipe:
# the mouth on the beach at 45 -6 (ground ~3), kit_st (yaw 270) 7.3 m in to the den room round 24 -6 (zone ss_cellar).
island Storm Spire keep
offset 7.039 -3.2112
hour 11
weather Calm
picture ss_cave_out 54 5.6 -4 45 4.8 -6
walk 51 -6 to 45 -6 to 38 -6 to 31 -6 to 25 -6
wait 2
expect message storm cellar
picture ss_cave_in 33 5.6 -6 20 5.0 -6 light=20
walk 25 -6 to 31 -6 to 38 -6 to 45 -6 to 51 -6 below=7
